\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0  I'll never forget Jesus,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And He, the same to me,
\par His love that He gave to me
\par For my life will not fade
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par When I was in great distress
\par He came to redeem me
\par And always new love I see
\par In my Lord Saviour's Love.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  He that gives me such a grace,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Can't I so give such love?
\par He came in time of troubles
\par That I may be so glad
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par They nailed Him unto the cross
\par He takes my sins away
\par And calls me from His heavens
\par That I may follow Him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  He was so touched by my pains
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And went through so great pains
\par He brought to me unworthy,
\par Eternal life and peace
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In my death in the future,
\par He will stretch His own hand,
\par Defendeth me in my death,
\par That my faith shall not fade.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. His own flesh and His own blood
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 That He gives unto me
\par  My mockery He takes away,
\par  His happiness fills me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He wants to give me His grace
\par   And His eternal light
\par That I may stay with Him too
\par And I shall have His peace
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  O, Jesus, shine in my life
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  In happiness and pains
\par  And make me to remember
\par  Thy blood that shed for me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I'll love you with a pure love
\par And have my hope on you.
\par  Lead me to that my real home
\par \pard      I shall ever have joy.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

